              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Higher discount levels create greater variability and increased risk of negative-profit transactions. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Smaller discounts generate more stable and consistent profit outcomes. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
