              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#508f46'>Top-performing categories </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>should remain priority investment areas to sustain revenue and profit growth. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#266799'>Growth-potential categories</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'> may benefit from expanded marketing, bundling, or increased visibility strategies. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b'>Uder-performing categorie</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>s generating high revenue but lower profit may require pricing optimization or cost-control improvements. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Persistently </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#bc494b'>underperforming categories </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>should be evaluated for repositioning, operational changes, or reduced emphasis.</run>
