                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>Regional revenue trends show steady long-term growth across all regions despite seasonal fluctuations.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The West region generated the strongest overall revenue contribution, while the East region also demonstrated significant growth momentum. The South and Central regions contributed smaller but steadily increasing revenue shares over time.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>Revenue peaks become larger and more frequent toward 2019, supporting earlier findings that company growth was driven by increasing order volume and improved sales performance in later years.</run>
